><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250709121054+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250709121056+10'00'" name="4787d0b8-fce6-4759-bcd3-98836b397190" page="0" coords="51.000000,461.997864,204.134155,461.997864,51.000000,451.197906,204.134155,451.197906,42.000000,450.990906,204.156693,450.990906,42.000000,440.190918,204.156693,440.190918,42.000000,439.983887,204.137543,439.983887,42.000000,429.183929,204.137543,429.183929,42.000000,428.976929,204.170334,428.976929,42.000000,418.176941,204.170334,418.176941,42.000000,417.969910,204.164352,417.969910,42.000000,407.169952,204.164352,407.169952,200.773315,408.077026,204.090958,408.077026,200.773315,400.916626,204.090958,400.916626,42.000000,406.962952,201.075150,406.962952,42.000000,396.162964,201.075150,396.162964,42.001907,395.940918,204.152802,395.940918,42.001907,385.140930,204.152802,385.140930,42.001907,384.933899,204.166077,384.933899,42.001907,374.133942,204.166077,374.133942,42.001907,373.926941,204.130402,373.926941,42.001907,363.126953,204.130402,363.126953,42.001907,362.919922,204.102173,362.919922,42.001907,352.119965,204.102173,352.119904,42.001907,351.912903,204.160370,351.912903,42.001907,341.112946,204.160370,341.112946,42.001907,340.905945,204.168259,340.905945,42.001907,330.105957,204.168259,330.105957,42.001907,329.898926,204.162308,329.898926,42.001907,319.098969,204.162308,319.098969,42.001907,318.891968,204.146713,318.891968,42.001907,308.091980,204.146713,308.091980,42.001907,307.884949,204.091843,307.884949,42.001907,297.084991,204.091843,297.084991,42.001907,296.877991,204.161880,296.877991,42.001907,286.078003,204.161880,286.078003,116.989609,286.967102,120.307251,286.967102,116.989609,279.806702,120.307251,279.806702,42.001907,285.870972,117.252441,285.870972,42.001907,275.071014,117.252441,275.071014" rect="41.662491,274.733521,204.507843,462.335388" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>‘Non-contact’&#xD;and wheelchair rugby in&#xD;particular provide a wide range of physical&#xD;health benefits, including a reduction in&#xD;cardiometabolic risk factors such as resting&#xD;heart rate, blood pressure, glycated haemoglobin&#xD;levels and total body fat mass.</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#0000FF;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>1&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Though the research is more limited, data&#xD;also suggest that participating in rugby union&#xD;has beneficial effects on numerous proxy&#xD;measures for mental health and well-being.&#xD;The evidence is either mixed or unclear in&#xD;relation to ‘contact’ rugby union and its&#xD;effects on a range of physical health domains.&#xD;Injury and concussion incidence rates are&#xD;high for contact forms of rugby union relative&#xD;to other sports, especially at the elite&#xD;level of competition.</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#0000FF;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>1</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="0" rect="595.276001,369.997864,779.276001,461.997864"
/></highlight
